Research-only normal-force/normalized-moment body radiation; shipping untouched.
Original native source snapshot35075391; also verified against69d5e4f7.
Measured d0 g21/g34 banks127/141modes; no measured horizontal-force response.
Audition protocol disables longitudinalGain identically because its axial-force
projection is unresolved; all six actual idle-string bridge loads remain.
Raw endpoint gates pass before authored body morphology. Inherited calibration
failed the controlled six-clip real-recording comparison; no improvement claim.

Measurement author: Robert Mores. Source: https://zenodo.org/records/4604577
Licensed CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Modified using the calibrated H1/window/joint-pole fitting procedure in
Tools/GenerateBodyForcePair.py and the endpoint-to-F/T residue transform.

